{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_049_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:59832defa858aa416403c556a26abf9e8b420f6685e32e699221b7417a2309c8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f69baaf6a0d4d60e5165aa146b1d0192709174d25e01035467035e551c0b6579",
      "text": "倒也算不上“很熟悉”……不过确实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:caba443e5bac001c21c485dce3731052a88bb97ab320c871afd3fe09fb71547b",
      "text": "在坊间一般都被说成是一个\n除了创作作品外一概不关心的怪人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:291d15eaa9cf088007d3f2aa4a3909dad19f5252f055759f48a34f5a9811f2a7",
      "text": "据说如果演员的演技不能令他满意，\n在现场也会毫不留情地狠狠贬低。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6672f17a5e58c4918f23fd1947628f531dcec2929e0fa14009cdb9b5f6c5a74",
      "text": "虽然他好像还挺看好我父母的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70f8363101a12f9d7c4d60469f78b1ef3b476027ab053aa891a039c74ec67b53",
      "text": "总之，就是喜恶分明。\n而且会堂堂正正地表现出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c72a1d12bcb75b1e7cf6678466e17c446e12fcdf4f03f509238f2aa0dadab6dd",
      "text": "看来是个作风相当激烈的人呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4a4d5823622dd40fe0e1c39edb544b4a0e7bc7986881038ee803285f98f9af6",
      "text": "是啊。作为人际交往的对象，我也并不擅长应付这类人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef579f953c6ff5eb7d1bc1ec5d6391b5f41146b29ffa6adbedfd647a6465d81d",
      "text": "但对他的作品则是另一回事了。\n虽然确实有很多讽刺意味的表现手法……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcc75b385e615c665256b5702b79746d0ecebc9ce61fa232db09c926b2cc4031",
      "text": "……不，让你带有太多先入为主的观念也不好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5a7787e55f45d971d845c307fbcd11e2e61838ea83b99f186afb1cb0e41b911",
      "text": "制作人，周末要是不介意的话要不要来我家？\n一起去看看他的名作电影……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09d3fca76a589c71e08b453944b6664e65020279081f090dece11595357a9a65",
      "text": "……也是为了制定试镜对策，\n提前看上几部会比较好。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
